    "title": "Axtell and Wilcox-Hildreth Compete at Falcon Invite - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Roger Hansen ,\n11 hours ago Twelve schools competed at the Falcon Invite in Wilcox on March 27th. Axtell’s girls won the meet and the Wilcox-Hildreth girls were 4th. On the boy’s side, the Falcons were 3rd and the Cats were 10th. Boys’ team scores were Loomis 88, Elm Creek 70, Wil-Hil 61, Amherst... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
